      "width": 360, "height": 66,
      "text": "Dynamic Quantization  ← KEY STEP\nBF16 [M, N]  →  FP8 [M, N]\nQDQ: 1 scale  |  RowWise: M scales\nBlockWise: M × N/128 scales  (all online)",
